confidence: high
resolution: Health vector refresh is now opt-in through refreshVectors; the default health path never contacts the embedding provider and reports refresh_disabled deterministically.
expected_result: "pm health remains non-blocking by default even with a configured hanging embedding provider, while explicit refresh remains bounded and observable."
actual_result: "Provider call-count and hanging-provider abort tests pass; default, unavailable-runtime, and no-stale-item branches are covered in the full exact-head suite."
